factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says 'உள்ளாட்சிகள் தினத்தையொட்டி' and the article says the meeting is on 1st (வரும், 1ம் தேதி); the draft's 'நவ. 1' is consistent with the article's later reference to நவ., 1ம் தேதி, so no conflict there, but the caption's wording 'நவம்பர் 1' is also supported.
  The reel_script states that the complaints from 'ஆகஸ்ட் 15, அக்டோபர் 2' meetings will be asked about, but the article says the Aug 15 and Oct 2 meetings were held after the TVK government formed; the draft's 'ஆக. 15, அக். 2 கூட்டங்களின் புகார்களுக்கு நடவடிக்கை இல்லை' in slide 3 asserts there was no action taken on those complaints, which the article does not state (it only says people will ask about actions taken).
  The reel_script claims the Oct 2 and Aug 15 complaints have 'no action', which is an overstatement: the article says people are preparing to ask what action was taken, not that no action was taken for those specific meetings.
  The reel_script says complaints of the 11 panchayats lack drinking water, road and streetlight facilities; the article says these basic facilities are not fully implemented in the panchayats (mainly the older ones), so 'முழுமையாக இல்லை' overstates it relative to the article's 'முழுமையாக நிறைவேற்றப்படாமல்' for the older panchayats only.
  The reel_script omits the detail that the meeting is organized by the panchayats for 'உள்ளாட்சிகள் தினம்' is included, but it omits the key point that complaints have been raised at every gram sabha without action (an important fact of the article).
